 "words_heard": 199,
 "words": 219,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The land of Seir held the old ways",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Horite chiefs kept the mountain days",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Lotan and Shobal stood the test",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Zibeon and Anah were the best",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dishon and Eshban stood tall who lived in the land",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 2.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dishan was the last of the band",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "These were the sons of Seir the Horite",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the place that they called their site",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hemdan and Eshban stood tall",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ithran and Keran heard the call",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sons of Dishon in the genealogy",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Names written in the history",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the Esauites took the land",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They walked across the Seir land",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The descendants of Esau came near",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They drove the old clans from the sphere",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Wiped them out and settled in place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Just like Israel in that location",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-eight years the men did fade",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hand of the Lord was in the shade",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To root them out until they perished",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the Lord had sworn and whispered",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hemdan and Eshban stood tall",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ithran and Keran heard the call",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sons of Dishon in the genealogy",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Names written in the history",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the Esauites took the land",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They walked across the Seir land",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Anah had a son named Dishon",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 27.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His lineage is not forgotten",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cherans and Kerans keep the name",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though the power slowly changed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They lived in Seir to this day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 9.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the shadow of the sway",
